<p>Results can be filtered by instrument kind (future, option, etc.). This method provides a quick overview of market activity across all instruments for a currency.</p>
<p><strong>Note:</strong> For real-time updates, we recommend using the WebSocket subscription to <code>ticker.{instrument_name}.{interval}</code> instead of polling this endpoint.</p>
<p><strong>📖 Related Articles:</strong></p>
