<p class="whitespace-pre-line"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">📖 Related Article:</span> <a href="https://docs.deribit.com/articles/currency-parameter" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="link">Using the currency Parameter</a></p>
<p class="whitespace-pre-line">Currency, i.e <code node="[object Object]"><span>"BTC"</span></code>, <code node="[object Object]"><span>"ETH"</span></code>, <code node="[object Object]"><span>"USDC"</span></code></p></div><div class="whitespace-pre-wrap prose-sm mt-6">Available options<!-- -->:<!-- --> <div class="inline-block"><code>BTC</code>,<!-- --> </div><div class="inline-block"><code>ETH</code>,<!-- --> </div><div class="inline-block"><code>USDC</code>,<!-- --> </div><div class="inline-block"><code>USDT</code>,<!-- --> </div><div class="inline-block"><code>EURR</code> </div></div></div></div></div><div class="primitive-param-field border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 border-b last:border-b-0"><div class="py-6"><div class="flex font-mono text-sm group/param-head param-head break-all relative" id="parameter-kind"><div class="flex-1 flex flex-col content-start py-0.5 mr-5"><div class="flex items-center flex-wrap gap-2"><div class="absolute -top-1.5"><a href="#parameter-kind" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover/param-head:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 py-2 [.expandable-content_&amp;]:-ml-[2.1rem] group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8.5 6.827C8.148 6.995 7.818 7.225 7.527 7.517L7.517 7.527C6.136 8.908 6.136 11.146 7.517 12.527L9.692 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-li