\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_openapi.json get /private/get_lsp_usage\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/lsp/private-get_lsp_usage\"}]},{\"group\":\"Market Data\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"public/get_apr_history\",\"description\":\"Retrieves historical Annual Percentage Rate (APR) data for yield-generating tokens. APR represents the annualized return rate for holding these tokens on Deribit.\\n\\nThis method is only applicable to yield-generating tokens: `USDE`, `STETH`, `USDC`, and `BUILD`. Use the `limit` parameter to specify the number of days to retrieve (default 365, maximum 365), and `before` to retrieve APR history before a specific epoch day.\\n\\n**📖 Related Support Article:** [Yield reward-bearing coins](https://support.deribit.com/hc/en-us/articles/31424939199261-Yield-reward-bearing-coins)\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_apr_history)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_openapi.json get /public/get_apr_history\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/market-data/public-get_apr_history\"},{\"title\":\"public/get_book_summary_by_currency\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_openapi.json get /public/get_book_summary_by_currency\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/market-data/public-get_book_summary_by_currency\"},{\"title\":\"public/get_book_summary_by_instrument\",\"description\":\"Retrieves summary information such as open interest, 24-hour volume, best bid/ask prices, last trade price, mark price, and other market statistics for a specific instrument.\\n\\nThis method provides a quick overview of current market activity and liquidity for a single instrument.\\n\\n[Try in API console](https://test.deribit.com/api_console?method=%2Fpublic%2Fget_book_summary_by_instrument)\\n\\n\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_openapi.json get /public/get_book_summary_by_instrument\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/market-data/public-get_book_summary_by_instrument\"},{\"title\":\"public/get_contract_size\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_openapi.json get /public/get_contract_size\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/market-data/public-get_contract_size\"},{\"title\":\"public/get_currencies\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_openapi.json get /public/get_currencies\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/market-data/public-get_currencies\"},{\"title\":\"public/get_delivery_prices\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_openapi.json get /public/get_delivery_prices\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/market-data/public-get_delivery_prices\"},{\"title\":\"public/get_expirations\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_openapi.json get /public/get_expirations\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/market-data/public-get_expirations\"},{\"title\":\"public/get_funding_chart_data\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_openapi.json get /public/get_funding_chart_data\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/market-data/public-get_funding_chart_data\"},{\"title\":\"public/get_funding_rate_history\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_openapi.json get /public/get_funding_rate_history\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/market-data/public-get_funding_rate_history\"},{\"title\":\"public/get_funding_rate_value\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_openapi.json get /public/get_funding_rate_value\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/market-data/public-get_funding_rate_value\"},{\"title\":\"public/get_historical_volatility\",\"deprecated\":null,\"version\":null,\"openapi\":\"/specifications/deribit_openapi.json get /public/get_historical_volatility\",\"href\":\"/api-reference/market-data/public-get_historical_volatility\"},{\"title\":\"public/get_index_price\",\"deprecated\":null,\"